Thumbs.db

# --- Secrets: never commit provider keys ---
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.key

# --- Case study corpus ---
# Full post text and screenshots stay out of the repository: what is committed is
# a redacted URL, a content hash and a short quote. See case-study/README.md.
# results/ is deliberately NOT ignored — the generated report is the deliverable.
case-study/corpus/

# --- Case study inbox ---
# Where posts are dropped for `make ingest` to digest. Both the drops and where they
# end up are local; only the manifest entry is committed.
case-study/inbox/
